479	/// predicate in the same `if`, so inverting the comparison (`<` for `>`), dropping it, or quietly
480	/// raising the cap all shipped green. Text, with no NUL anywhere, is the whole point: a binary
481	/// oversized fixture would be rejected by `looks_binary` first and prove nothing about the size.
482	///
