687	// The fourth `None` producer, `MaterializedTreeValue::AccessDenied`, is deliberately NOT tested
688	// here, because reaching it would cost more truth than it buys. In jj-lib 0.43.0 the only source of
689	// the `BackendError::ReadAccessDenied` it wraps is `secret_backend.rs` ("Provides a backend for
