695	//      dev-profile build (`cargo check --all-targets`, `clippy`, `test`) — so the jj-lib under test
696	//      would be configured differently from the jj-lib we ship;
697	//   2. a fixture that overwrites `.jj/repo/store/type` with "secret", which makes the repo
